          "id": "e9688b1af0d1e1138a25cd777ddd50eb083ffdee",
          "message": "fix(dpa+mesh) stabilize atomesh routing sticky and scheduling (#1886)\n\n* fix(dpa): preserve DP rank for non-streaming prefill\n\nForward the mesh-selected data_parallel_rank through all non-streaming chat paths so EngineCore honors sticky affinity.\n\nadd ut for dp_sticky of mesh\n\nfix(dpa): preserve DP rank for streaming PD transfers\n\nfix(openai): accept DP rank in chat completion requests\n\n* fix(scheduler): recover missing deferred-output placeholders\n\nfix format\n\n* fix(dpa): apply role-specific DP rendezvous ports to avoid prefill/decode conflicts\n\nadd ut for role-specific DP rendezvous ports\n\n* [ci][mesh] refactor glm-5.2 dpa cases\n\n[ci][mesh] add glm-52-mxfp4-1p1d-tp4-dpa-agentic-lmcache-1m conc24/32 case",
